  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INDEPTH network 2013-2017 - INDEPTH 2013-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INDEPTH network 2013-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INDEPTH network (International Network for the Demographic Evaluation of Populations &amp; Their Health) ett internationellt n&#xe4;tverk m 43       demografiska forskningsstationer f&#xf6;r befolkningsstudier i 20 l&#xe5;g- och medelinkomstl&#xe4;nder. Genom dessa forskningsstationer f&#xf6;ljs sammanlagt  3,2 miljoner m&#xe4;nniskor, vilket ger unik information om                befolkningstrender i dessa l&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the International Network for the Demographic Evaluation   of Populations and their Health (INDEPTH, an Africa, asian and Latin  American network of demographic suites to provide better, empirical   understanding of health and social issues and to apply this           understanding to alleviate severe health and social changes.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">There is no current support to INDEPTH. The contribution is to be closed once the audited report for year 2017 is submitted and repayment of costs for which the KPMG audit did not find sufficient documentation is settled. USD 200 000 has been repaid in 2023 and USD 100 000 is yet to be repaid.</narrative>
  </description>
